{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defy two empires and smash the duopoly in an adorable, quirky puzzle adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world dominated by <strong>Alphabarn</strong> and <strong>Omegamart</strong>, the twin supermarket overlords of <i>Duopolis</i>, a shopping cart awakens to find themselves abandoned, like so many others - destined to be destroyed and replaced. Teaming up with scrappy, an abandoned receipt, they begin their quest to <i>free</i> <i>all cartkind</i> from the devious plans of the evil duopoly and <strong>forge their own path to freedom.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">60 LEVELS OF COZY, TURN-BASED PUZZLE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spanning 5 different regions of Duopolis - each with their own quirks, characters and challenges. From the forest to the carpark, the supermarket to the sewers and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/bc-about-levels.png?t=1753494315\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SMASH THE DUOPOLY IN A CINEMATIC SATIRICAL ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow our two heroes\u2019 journey in a heartfelt, funny, satirical story about consumerism, duopoly and waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/bc-about-cinematic.png?t=1753494315\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULL FEATURED LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finished the story? Make your own! Create an infinite number of levels and challenge your friends with fiendish shopping cart puzzles of your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/bc-about-editor.png?t=1753494315\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMING FOR CHANGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to Clean Up Australia</strong> or an equivalent charity for international players. The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/bc-about-change.png?t=1753494315\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750760?t=1753494315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/9f7363320c66731acb5c1ddebb8b2ee190567590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753494315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/9dec16dea7b9f64dde01f1b1959668e2b026ba66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753494315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/9dec16dea7b9f64dde01f1b1959668e2b026ba66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753494315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"