b_paragraph\">BraveCart isn\u2019t just a game. We want it to make a real impact for a sustainable future. To address this, we will be donating <strong>10% of every sale to Clean Up Australia</strong> or an equivalent charity for international players. The game also features a \u201cTrolley Tracker\u201d, enabling players to report abandoned trolleys in real life whenever they find them, so they can be retrieved and reused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/extras/bc-about-change.png?t=1753494315\" /></div></p>","developers":["Hojo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750760/cd676979f49a6d3fa0018511bc62ccdf1fdd2cff/header.jpg?t=1753494315","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All content and code copyright Quad Goals Pty. Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Mac integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Mac Sound Card</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140467,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140467/movie480.mp4?t=1749322044","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140467/movie_max.mp4?t=1749322044"},"name":"BraveCart Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140467/2c06769c7526026853bb70de1eaa3a6115d03930/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749322044","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140467/movi